WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.240
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.260
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.290
Just a little more,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.180
Just a little bit more,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.720
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.550
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.760
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.490
You smiled at me,

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.520
Like a leaf swaying in the wind.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:49.240
It seems as though my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.330
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.020
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.160
Just a little more,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.050
Just a little bit more,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.970
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:09.620
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.820
And understand what I'm saying to you!

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.640
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:21.660
This excitement will never stop!

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:08.560
Geez, it's gonna be hot today.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:17.490
I have training today, so I should bring a change of clothes.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.600
You have 1 new email.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.430
01. Aoba Riku. Good morning.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.470
01. Aoba Riku. Good morning.

00:02:56.070 --> 00:03:00.910
An Exciting Time

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.920
All right class, summer vacation starts tomorrow!

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:27.260
Listen, even though it's summer vacation, you shouldn't eat too much, and you should behave yourselves.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:24.050
Don't drink too much. Don't eat too much. Behave yourselves.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:24.050
Reading down:  Don't drink too much.  Don't eat too much.  Behave yourselves.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:30.310
But you should make sure to stay active during the vacation.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:34.650
So she says, but summer vacation is the best time to be free!

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:35.610
Exactly.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:39.190
You can't predict what's going to happen during summer vacation.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:40.860
Right, Riku-kun?

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:43.990
Yeah.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.540
Thank goodness!

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.840
So anyway, I think we'll come back with happy faces, after our lovely summer vacation.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:04:01.630
Kasuga Tsukasa. Subject: Good Morning.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:04:01.630
Thanks for your email! It's gonna be hot today, but I'll try not to train too hard!

00:03:56.630 --> 00:04:01.630
Sub-menu

00:03:58.840 --> 00:03:59.920
It's over!

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:10.020
Let's make some plans for our summer vacation later.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.310
I can't, I've got club.

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.310
You're coming too, right Amamiya-san?

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:18.070
C'mon, Sayuri, let's go!

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:20.990
Amamiya-san.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.320
Yes, I'm coming right away.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:28.450
Amamiya-san, I was thinking of discussing the culture festival preparations with you...

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.040
I'll contact you about that some other time.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.120
But we have to decide what to display.

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.210
Sorry. I'm busy today, so...

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:43.300
Geez! He's so bold when it comes to Amamiya-san!

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.400
Damn! He's the one who confessed his love to Amamiya-san!

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:49.510
No! That wasn't it!

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.890
That was a misunderstanding!

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:54.770
I was auditioning for a play, and you happened to walk in...

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.350
Y-Yes.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:00.270
I just happened to walk in, and I saw that.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.400
His confession was more dramatic than a play.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.360
I'd have been so touched by it if I'd been there!

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.030
Don't tease me!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.830
So it was true.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.660
Not you too, Ayame!

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.120
G-Geez!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.630
Hey! Amamiya-san!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:20.670
I'll see you later, Aoba-kun.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.180
I-Is Aoba-san here?

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.350
Yayoi-san?

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:39.360
Will you come and watch me train today?

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.860
Don't screw with me!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:51.700
There!

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.620
Hey! Do it properly!

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:05.630
Sorry about that!

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:14.770
Kasuga-san!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:30.990
Um... It really is hot today. Where are you going?

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:36.450
Yeah. She asked me to watch her train for the swim club.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:44.920
Don't train too hard. Don't hurt yourself.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.420
It's finally time for our summer vacation, after all.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:47.800
See ya.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:50.930
Hey, Kasuga-san!

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:56.310
Um... About what happened before...

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:01.270
To make up for that, I'll take you somewhere else, okay?

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.480
I'm busy with my club.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:18.950
Hey, you!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:24.130
Summer vacation hasn't started yet, so don't lose focus! We're gonna train hard today!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.090
Yes!

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:28.170
Who's going to be my partner for the beach volleyball competition?

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:28.840
Next!

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.220
Let's train hard together!

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:31.800
Here!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.600
What's wrong, Tsukasa?

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.310
Are you feeling ill?

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:47.110
No, I'm fine.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.320
Please let me try again, Captain.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:50.320
Here!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.240
No way!

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:00.620
Oh dear! I was up too late surfing the web last night!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:06.710
Go for a run outside and cool your head.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.630
Got it!

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:10.880
Tsukasa!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.550
Hey, are you all right?

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:14.970
Ayame.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:16.930
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.010
Something happened, right?

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:26.020
I just didn't get enough sleep last night.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.070
I'm going for a little run.

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:33.740
Ayame!

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.160
Do you want to go for a run too?

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.030
No, Captain!

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:52.010
Okay.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.090
Aoba-san, how was my time?

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:57.760
Let's see...

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.600
Yeah. You improved a bit.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.600
But it's still not my best time.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:09.060
Say, why don't we take a short break?

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:11.480
Okay.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:18.160
How do you feel? Have you gotten over your anxiety?

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:21.120
Yes, thanks to you, I...

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:31.340
By any chance, are you worried about something outside of the swim club?

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:40.760
Um...

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:44.680
What's wrong?

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:54.070
Will you come home with me today?

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.000
This is a shortcut to my place.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:10.960
I see.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.380
It's the first time I've taken this road.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:17.630
Hold on.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.900
I never knew that there was such a lovely place here.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:38.990
It's called the Tsumugi Shrine.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:39.910
Oh.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.070
But why are you interested in shrines?

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:43.870
Never mind that.

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:49.920
Donations

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:10.350
I pray that Yayoi-san will improve her time at the next swimming competition.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:15.020
Aren't you going to pray as well?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:22.070
Well, I'd like to improve my time on my own, without relying on any gods.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.660
If I do that, I'm sure that I...

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:33.580
Really? Yeah, that's right.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:37.000
But if it was a request...

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:45.720
I'd like Aoba-san to call me Mina.

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:54.520
Let's see...

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:57.400
Mina-chan.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:30.180
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love. Please call me Mina.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.770
I'm not here, but I'm Hoshina Naomi.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:35.600
Nice to meet you!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.900
The signs read, "Delicious Grilled Chicken Skewers! 30 Yen Each!"

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:46.570
Delicious Grilled Chicken Skewers! 30 Yen Each!

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:48.780
Preparations...

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.410
There are all kinds of jobs that need to be done!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.790
How many of these are there?

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:59.210
There's no end to them!

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:03.210
Practicing to be a knight, Riku-kun?

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:05.340
Hiyoko-kun!

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.930
Why are you here?

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:13.160
I'm visiting the weak to provide encouragement.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.350
Oh, I'm so happy, Hiyoko-kun!

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.980
I can't do any more on my own!

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:22.460
And in the end, I'll just be a bother.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.700
Huh? Are you leaving already, Hiyoko-kun?

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.200
Amamiya-san!

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:33.080
Sorry I'm late.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.120
Um... Amamiya-san?

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.750
About that audition...

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:22.840
It seems everyone's spreading weird rumors around, but it really was a coincidence.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:28.880
But it looks like I caused trouble for you.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:29.840
I'm sorry.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:30.550
I...

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.560
It really was a coincidence, right?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.600
It's all right if it was just a coincidence, right?

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:42.810
Yes, of course!

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:49.530
Then it doesn't matter.

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:50.820
Right?

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:53.990
Yeah.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:15:00.830
Oh, by the way, I didn't expect you to wear something like that.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.960
You look good no matter what you wear.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:05.500
Don't just talk. Get to work.

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.470
Tsukasa!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.590
What on earth is wrong with you?

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.970
You haven't even made one spike today!

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.980
Please let me try again!

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.990
What's wrong with me?

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.580
Huh? That's weird.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:39.870
Tsukasa!

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:41.920
You should take a break!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.750
It's nothing.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:44.710
Tsukasa!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.130
Captain! I'll get it right next time!

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.090
Make sure you concentrate this time.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:54.550
Here!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.100
TSUKASA!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.150
TSUKASA!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.240
Did you push yourself too hard again?

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:15.320
Oh dear.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:20.790
Well, you're just a little dizzy, so you'll be fine after some rest.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.290
Your fever will come down, too.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:23.750
No problem!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.290
Thank you very much.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:28.340
Please listen carefully.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:35.340
It's good to have a sport that you like, but you're a woman, so make sure you look after your body.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:36.260
Yes.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:39.890
You'll never get a boyfriend if you stay the way you are.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.480
I have a boyfriend.

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.820
Let's finish up for today.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.620
Yeah, good idea.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:05.710
I'll tidy that up, so you should get changed.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:09.290
No. Let's finish up together.

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:12.710
I guess so.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.060
Ayame.

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.270
Is training over?

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:26.390
Yeah, I guess.

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:28.440
What's wrong, Ayame?

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.360
Did something happen during training?

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.530
Yeah. To be honest, Tsukasa...

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.030
Kasuga-san hurt herself?

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:38.700
Kasuga-san!

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.120
What's your problem? You're so noisy!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:49.710
Look after your teeth

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.540
I'm sorry, Hoshino-sensei.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.580
Um... Where's Kasuga-san?

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.040
Geez. What are you thinking?

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:52.130
Kasuga-san?

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:59.810
Look after your teeth

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:54.420
Kasuga-san?

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:55.300
Kasuga-san!

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.430
Hold on a second.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.890
Sensei! Where's Kasuga-san?

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:02.930
She just had a little fall. Don't worry about it.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.020
She'll get better if she rests for a while.

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:14.570
But she's weaker than she looks.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:21.120
You're her boyfriend, right? Make sure you protect her.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.250
Maybe Kasugan-san....

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.440
This is also a part of being a youth, Riku.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.910
This is the last ball.

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:10.750
Please God, let me make the shot!

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:23.850
Riku-kun!

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:31.900
The next episode of Tokimeki Memorial: Only Love will air at 1:45am on the 27th of November.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.270
That's weird.

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.610
What... What's wrong with me?

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:41.820
The next episode of Tokimeki Memorial: Only Love will air at 1:45am on the 27th of November.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:40.320
Kasuga-san.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:48.790
Riku-kun.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:57.460
What's wrong? Why are you here at this hour?

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.800
I heard that you were having problems with your training.

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.850
Oh, I see.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:21.440
I caused problems for everyone in the volleyball club.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:30.620
Well, would you like me to train with you?

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.880
Train with you?

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:39.380
Come on. Let's start before the sun sets.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:43.800
Okay, let's do it!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.180
Are you ready, Kasuga-san?

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:49.430
Yes.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:51.350
Here!

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:05.700
I did it!

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:23.630
I feel great!

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.480
Kasuga-san, do you want to keep going?

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:13.060
Will you go to the beach with me?

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:37.210
When the morning sunlight streams through the window,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.250
I immediately think of you.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:54.220
Our love began at first sight.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:23:00.230
We have a bright future!

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:06.650
Because you are my destined man!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:17.330
I've always been searching for the feeling which broke my smile.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:24.340
I have grasped a piece of the miracle which fell into this world

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:30.260
I will run toward you, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.930
When we are together, we can overcome any obstacle!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:42.560
Our love is still young, but it's my treasure!

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:52.450
It's the ocean, Sayuri!

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:53.030
Yeah.

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:54.820
Wow! There are so many people here!

00:23:54.820 --> 00:23:56.620
It's hard to walk through them!

00:23:56.620 --> 00:24:00.040
But we should hurry and walk past them.

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:03.420
Note: Yakisoba is a Japanese fried noodle dish.

00:24:00.710 --> 00:24:03.420
We should have some yakisoba while we're at the beach!

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:04.540
It's so rubbery!

00:24:04.830 --> 00:24:06.130
It'll give you strong teeth!

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:07.840
The sun's too bright!

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:09.380
We're gonna shrivel up!

00:24:09.460 --> 00:24:12.430
We'll be fine, even though the UV rays are strong.

00:24:12.880 --> 00:24:15.140
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:16.350
An Exciting Sea.

00:24:16.550 --> 00:24:17.260
Please watch it!

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:19.520
You really think about the future, Sayuri.
